# Sothera, the Supervoid (CR 603.4, 607.2a, 701.21a, 122.6): Bot1's Memnite and Ornithopter die on turns 5 and 7, each time exiling one of Bot2's creatures with Sothera. At Bot1's turn-7 end step Bot1 controls no creature, so Sothera is sacrificed and Bot1 chooses one of the two exiled creature cards to put onto the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters; on the earlier end steps every player controlled a creature and nothing happened.

